== Description ==

'''Charcoal''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Campfire]]. It appears as an ingredient in 24 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Carbonized crystalline brick]], [[Titanium Ingot]], [[Tungsten Ingot]], [[Chrome Ingot]], [[Rebar]], [[Gunpowder]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

